corry (0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New look: light page, soft white cards, pill buttons and a gradient
    main action; timeline header; redesigned slideshow and welcome media.
  * New "System components" page: choice of init system (systemd default;
    SysVinit, OpenRC, runit) and boot loader (GRUB default; systemd-boot,
    rEFInd, Syslinux/EXTLINUX, U-Boot menu). Alternatives need internet and
    are checked against the firmware, architecture, filesystems, Secure Boot
    and the desktop; the replaced default is removed from the new system, and
    any failure falls back to the default with a warning.
  * Jobs corryinit and corrybootloader; grubcfg and bootloader step aside
    when another loader was installed.
  * Time zone preselected: Asia/Dili (Timor-Leste).
  * Documented exit codes of the launcher and the preflight check.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:40:48 +0000

corry (0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * One complete package per distribution: corry-edukasaun (built on Debian
    stable) and corry-debion (built on Debian testing). They replace the 0.1
    corry and profile packages, and Debian's calamares packages.
  * An "Install <product>" shortcut appears on every user's desktop as soon
    as the package is installed; it is removed with the package.
  * Start on Debian live images that keep GRUB out of the squashfs; GRUB comes
    from the ISO's package pool or the internet.
  * Install shim-signed and grub-efi-amd64-signed on 64-bit UEFI systems so
    the installed system starts with Secure Boot on (best effort).
  * No -dbgsym packages; install-corry-debs.sh installs with apt.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0900

corry (0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian packages of Corry, the installer for Edukasaun OS and
    DebION GNU/Linux (based on Calamares 3.3.15).
  * corry replaces Debian's calamares and calamares-settings-debian and
    purges what is left of them.
  * corry-edukasaun and corry-debion make Corry the default installer.

